[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u805E\u3044\u305F\u305E\uFF5E\uFF1F\n\u4E8C\u4EBA\u3067\u3042\u306E\u4E8B\u4EF6\u89E3\u6C7A\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3063\u3066\uFF5E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard all about it~!\nSo you two solved that incident all by yourselves~?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3078\u3078\u2026\u2026\u6B63\u78BA\u306B\u306F\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3084\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0\u3055\u3093\u305F\u3061\u306B\u3082\n\u5354\u529B\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3063\u3066\u89E3\u6C7A\u3057\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ehehe... Well, actually, Juna and Magda helped us solve it too..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30A4\u30EB\u754C\u9688\u304B\u3089\u306F\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u305F\u3061\u3060\u3051\u3067\n\u89E3\u6C7A\u3057\u305F\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3046\u98A8\u306B\u805E\u3044\u3066\u308B\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But from what I heard around Firil, everyone\u0027s saying you two solved it all on your own!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Riane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u5F85\u3063\u3066\u3001\u306A\u306B\u305D\u306E\u754C\u9688\uFF01\uFF1F\n\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u521D\u8033\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold on, what\u0027s with this \u0022around Firil\u0022 stuff!?\nThis is the first I\u0027m hearing about this!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u304D\u3063\u304B\u3051\u306B\u3001\u3042\u306E\u4E8C\u4EBA\u306F\u5929\u624D\u30B3\u30F3\u30D3\u3067\u3042\u308B\u3068\n\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30A4\u30EB\u754C\u9688\u304B\u3089\u306F\u8CDE\u8CDB\u306E\u5D50\u304C\u6B62\u307E\u3089\u3093\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Because of this incident, the praise for these two as a genius duo hasn\u0027t stopped pouring in from around Firil..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u307E\u3067\u8B0E\u754C\u9688\u3092\u30B5\u30E9\u30C3\u3068\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even Juna is casually talking about this mysterious scene...!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3001\u3067\u3082\u3053\u308C\u3067\u3088\u3046\u3084\u304F\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u304C\u5929\u624D\u3060\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3068\u3001\n\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u5468\u308A\u306E\u4EBA\u305F\u3061\u306B\u4F1D\u308F\u3063\u305F\u306E\u306A\u3089\u3044\u3044\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-well, I suppose it\u0027s fine if everyone finally recognizes my genius..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u672C\u5F53\u306F\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3088\u308A\u3082\u3059\u3054\u3044\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3068\u3092\n\u8A8D\u3081\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3044\u305F\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3051\u3069\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though I would\u0027ve liked them to acknowledge that I\u0027m actually better than Firis..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u3001\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u5929\u624D\u306A\u306E\u306F\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D\u3047",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But Il-chan, you really are the genius here, you know?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3063\u3066\u308F\u305F\u3057\u3060\u3051\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3089\u3001\u3053\u3093\u306A\u306B\u8272\u3093\u306A\u4EBA\u304B\u3089\n\u307B\u3081\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3046\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3053\u3068\u3001\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3060\u308D\u3046\u3057",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I mean, if it was just me, I wouldn\u0027t have gotten praised by so many people like this"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E8B\u4EF6\u89E3\u6C7A\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3001\u307B\u3068\u3093\u3069\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\u4F5C\u6226\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF1F\n\u3055\u3059\u304C\u3068\u3057\u304B\u8A00\u3044\u3088\u3046\u304C\u306A\u3044\u3088\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The incident was solved mostly thanks to your strategy, right?\nYou\u0027re just amazing, there\u0027s no other way to put it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3075\u3063",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hmph"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\uFF5E\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u5F53\u7136\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF01\n\u3060\u3063\u3066\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306F\u6B63\u771F\u6B63\u9298\u306E\u5929\u624D\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3082\u306E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmhmm! Of course!\nAfter all, I am a genuine genius!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3088\u306D\u3047\uFF01\u3000\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u82B8\u4EBA\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u4E00\u6D41\uFF01\n\u2026\u2026\u306A\u3001\u4E8C\u4EBA\u306F\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3082\u30D3\u30FC\u30C3\u30B0\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s right! First-class as both alchemists and entertainers!\n...Y-you two are so BIIIG!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3078\u3078\uFF5E\u3002\u30D3\u30FC\u30C3\u30B0\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ehehe~ BIIIG!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3075\u3075\u3001\u4E8C\u4EBA\u306E\u8F1D\u304D\u306F\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\u8A00\u3046\u901A\u308A\u5927\u304D\u306A\n\u3082\u306E\u3088\u3002\u7D04\u675F\u3057\u305F\u901A\u308A\u3001\u79C1\u3068\u3082\u821E\u53F0\u3067\u8F1D\u304D\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Uhuhu, their radiance is indeed grand, just as Mieke says.\nAs promised, you\u0027ll shine with me on stage too, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3049\u3063\uFF1F\u3000\u306A\u3093\u3060\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3001\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1\u3082\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\n\u3053\u3044\u3064\u3089\u3068\u30CD\u30BF\u3084\u3063\u305F\u3089\u30A6\u30B1\u308B\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306D\u30FC\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh? What\u0027s this? If Mieke joins in with these two\u0027s act,\nit might actually be pretty good!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u65B0\u898F\u8DEF\u7DDA\u958B\u62D3\u3063\uFF01\n\u3044\u3084\u3041\u2026\u2026\u3002\u3044\u3044\u306D\u3047\u3001\u4E09\u4EBA\u76EE\u52A0\u5165\u3082\u71B1\u3044\u3058\u3083\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Branching into new territory!\nOh... This is great! A third member makes it even more exciting!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306E\u4E8C\u4EBA\u306E\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3055\u306B\u52A0\u3048\u3066\u30CF\u30B8\u3051\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306A\n\u6C7A\u3081\u30BC\u30EA\u30D5\u2026\u2026\u304B\u3002\u306A\u304B\u306A\u304B\u60AA\u304F\u306A\u3044\u305E\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those two\u0027s cuteness plus an explosive catchphrase...\nNot bad at all..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3042\u3041\uFF5E\u2026\u2026\uFF01\n\u3000\u305B\u3063\u304B\u304F\u4E0A\u624B\u3044\u3053\u3068\u8ECC\u9053\u4FEE\u6B63\u3057\u305F\u306E\u306B\uFF5E\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Aah~...!\nJust when I finally managed to fix things~!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3055\u3041\uFF01\u3000\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2\u3082\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u30D3\u30FC\u30C3\u30B0\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on! Ilmeria, join in...\nBIIIG!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307B\u3089\u3001\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u30D3\u30FC\u30C3\u30B0\uFF01\u3000\u3060\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, Il-chan! It\u0027s BIIIG time!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3048\u3047\uFF5E\u3044\uFF01\u3000\u30D3\u30FC\u30C3\u30B0\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Oh, fine! BIIIG!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3063\u306F\u3063\u306F\u3063\u306F\u3063\uFF01\n\u898B\u3066\u308B\u3060\u3051\u3067\u5143\u6C17\u306B\u306A\u308A\u305D\u3046\u3060\u305C\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahahahaha!\nJust watching them gets me fired up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u3044\u3044\u3088\uFF01\u3000\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u306F\u3053\u308C\u3067\u3044\u3053\u3046\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! Perfect! Let\u0027s keep this going from now on!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3093\u3075\u3063\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*snrk*...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3084\u306F\u308A\u304A\u524D\u305F\u3061\u306F\u82B8\u4EBA\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you really are entertainers after all..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u82B8\u4EBA\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3063\u3066\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF5E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I keep telling you we\u0027re not entertainers~!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3057\u304B\u3057\u305D\u308C\u304C\u6C7A\u307E\u308A\u6587\u53E5\u306E\u30CD\u30BF\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But that was clearly a rehearsed bit..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u9055\u3046\u306E\u3088\uFF5E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It really isn\u0027t like that~!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]